<td id="S4.T2.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Performance Metrics</td>
<td id="S4.T2.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">1/6</td>
<td id="S4.T2.2.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Continuous; normalized to <math id="S4.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<ul id="S4.I3" class="ltx_itemize ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel">
<li id="S4.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Note.</span> See mapping of PASS/WARN/FAIL to numeric scores and viability definition in Section <a href="#S4.SS5" title="4.5 Assessor Protocol and Scoring ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ app.build: A Production Framework for Scaling Agentic Prompt-to-App Generation with Environment Scaffolding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.5</span></a>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul></div></div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Results</h2>

<section id="S5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.1 </span>Environment Scaffolding Impact (TypeScript/tRPC only)</h3>

<div id="S5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Evaluating 30 TypeScript/tRPC applications, we observe that 73.3% (22/30) achieved viability (<math id="S5.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=1</annotation></semantics></math>), with 30.0% attaining perfect quality (<math id="S5.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q=10</annotation></semantics></math>) and 26.7% non-viable (<math id="S5.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=0</annotation></semantics></math>). Once viability criteria are met, generated applications exhibit consistently high quality.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Aggregated evaluation results for TypeScript/tRPC (<math id="S5.T3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=30</annotation></semantics></math> prompts). Viability <math id="S5.T3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math> and quality <math id="S5.T3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> are defined in Section <a href="#S4.SS5" title="4.5 Assessor Protocol and Scoring ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ app.build: A Production Framework for Scaling Agentic Prompt-to-App Generation with Environment Scaffolding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.5</span></a>. “Perfect quality” denotes <math id="S5.T3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q=10</annotation></semantics></math> (all applicable checks PASS). “Non-viable” denotes <math id="S5.T3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=0</annotation></semantics></math> (AB-01 or AB-02 = FAIL). Mean quality is computed over viable apps only (<math id="S5.T3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=1</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="S5.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S5.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Metric</th>
<th id="S5.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Value</th>
<th id="S5.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Key Insight</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Total Applications</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">30</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">TypeScript/tRPC stack only</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Viability Rate (<math id="S5.T3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=1</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">73.3%</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">22/30 viable applications</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Perfect Quality (<math id="S5.T3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q=10</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">30.0%</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">9/30 fully compliant applications</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Non-viable (<math id="S5.T3.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=0</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">26.7%</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">8/30 failed smoke tests</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Mean Quality (<math id="S5.T3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V=1</annotation></semantics></math> apps)</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">8.78</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">High quality when viable</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<ul id="S5.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel">
<li id="S5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Note.</span> Scoring rubric and check definitions in Section <a href="#S4.SS5" title="4.5 Assessor Protocol and Scoring ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ app.build: A Production Framework for Scaling Agentic Prompt-to-App Generation with Environment Scaffolding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.5</span></a>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul></div></div>
</figure>
<figure id="S5.T4" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Check-specific outcomes across <math id="S5.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=30</annotation></semantics></math> TypeScript/tRPC tasks. See Section <a href="#S4.SS5" title="4.5 Assessor Protocol and Scoring ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ app.build: A Production Framework for Scaling Agentic Prompt-to-App Generation with Environment Scaffolding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.5</span></a> for check definitions, PASS/WARN/FAIL grading, and the viability rule. NA indicates the check was not applicable to a prompt (e.g., AB-04 when no view/edit flows are required). “Pass Rate (excl. NA)” is computed over applicable cases only.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
